Package: its-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Toeshee <it@toeshee.example>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Toeshee-Lab/it-suite
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: ITMS endpoint agent
 One static Go binary per endpoint. It holds a single long-lived OUTBOUND
 mutual-TLS connection to the control plane and executes only jobs that are
 cryptographically signed by it. It opens no listening port and accepts no
 inbound connection.
 .
 The package installs the binary and the systemd unit but carries NO
 credentials: an enrollment token in a .deb would be a credential in a
 distributable artifact. Run `its-agent-enroll --url <control-plane>` with the
 token in the environment or on stdin after installing.
 .
 Depends on nothing: the binary is built CGO_ENABLED=0 and is statically
 linked, so it has no libc version floor and the same package runs on Ubuntu
 24.04 and later.
